> I read this as Investigation - inspect the Ferryx tab/session persistence surface and deliver a five-bullet repair-ready root-cause verdict with exact citations.

* **Confirmed mechanism**:
  * `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts:100-108`: `serializeWorkspaceState` builds a new `PersistedWorkspaceSession` with `workspaces: { [workspaceId]: workspace }`, completely dropping all other registered workspace entries when written to disk via `saveSession` in `ui/src/App.tsx:199,206`.
  * `ui/src/state/workspaceStore.ts:109` & `ui/src/App.tsx:110-120`: `useWorkspaceStore` initializes in-memory state via `useReducer` on mount. Switching projects via `handleSelectProject` (`ui/src/App.tsx:384-394`) changes `activeProject.workspaceId`, but when `loadSession` encounters the overwritten session file, `deserializeWorkspaceState` returns `null` (`ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts:121-122`), preventing `restoreWorkspace` (`ui/src/App.tsx:137`) and leaving the prior project's worktrees, tabs, and sessions active in state.
  * `ui/src/App.tsx:140-160`: On restart, dead sessions are respawned against `foundWorktree ? worktreeIdentity(foundWorktree) : null` (`ui/src/App.tsx:146-150`). If workspace isolation broke prior to restart, respawned backend PTYs bind to leaked worktree paths and cwd contexts.

* **Minimal files to edit**:
  * `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts` (accept and merge into existing `PersistedWorkspaceSession` map instead of replacing `workspaces` wholesale).
  * `ui/src/App.tsx` (pass current/loaded session map into serialization/save calls and ensure clean workspace state re-initialization/restore on project switch).
  * `ui/src/state/workspaceStore.ts` (provide clean reset/re-initialization when switching `workspaceId`).

* **Exact RED test file/name/assertion**:
  * **File**: `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts`
  * **Test name**: `"preserves multi-workspace session state and isolates tabs per worktree without clobbering other workspaces on serialize"`
  * **Assertion**:
    ```typescript
    // In ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts:
    const existingSession: PersistedWorkspaceSession = {
      version: 2,
      timestamp: 1000,
      activeWorkspaceId: "alpha",
      workspaces: {
        alpha: {
          workspaceId: "alpha",
          repoRoot: "/repo/alpha",
          worktrees: [{ path: "/repo/alpha", branch: "main", head: "111", isMain: true, isLocked: false }],
          activeWorktreePath: "/repo/alpha",
          layout: { splitMode: "none", primaryTabId: "tab-a", secondaryTabId: null, activeTabId: "tab-a", tabs: [{ id: "tab-a", label: "main", sessionId: "sess-a" }] },
          terminalSessions: { "sess-a": { localSessionId: "sess-a", backendSessionId: null, worktreePath: "/repo/alpha", cwd: "/repo/alpha", createdAt: 1000 } },
        },
      },
    };
    const stateBeta = {
      ...workspaceState(),
      activeWorktreePath: "/repo/beta",
      worktrees: [{ path: "/repo/beta", head: "222", branch: "main", bare: false, detached: false, locked: null, prunable: null }],
    };
    const serialized = serializeWorkspaceState("beta", "/repo/beta", stateBeta, existingSession);
    expect(serialized.workspaces.alpha).toBeDefined();
    expect(serialized.workspaces.beta).toBeDefined();
    expect(serialized.workspaces.alpha.layout.tabs.map((t) => t.id)).toEqual(["tab-a"]);
    expect(serialized.workspaces.beta.layout.tabs.map((t) => t.id)).not.toContain("tab-a");
    ```

* **Regression commands**:
  * `bun run --cwd ui test` (or `npx vitest run ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts ui/src/App.test.tsx ui/src/state/projectWorkspaceScope.test.tsx`)
  * `cargo test --test session_persistence_integration`

* **Risks to preserve**:
  * **v1 migration compatibility**: Legacy v1 unversioned payloads with flat session IDs and legacy tab schemas must continue migrating smoothly (`ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts:130,140,175-182` and `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts:167-248`).
  * **Live PTY reconciliation**: Live native PTY matching by `backendSessionId` during dev/HMR restart must avoid unnecessary terminal process respawns (`ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts:141-144`, `ui/src/App.tsx:135-160`, `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts:114-124`).
  * **Browser tab isolation**: Pinned and unpinned browser tabs must retain webview metadata (`browserId`, `url`, `canGoBack`, `canGoForward`) and never be mapped to terminal PTY sessions (`ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts:33-47,158-174`, `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts:136-165`).
  * **Split-pane leaf ownership & TabGroupLayout**: Multi-leaf terminal tab layouts (`sessionIdsByLeafId`) and group split topologies must remain preserved across project and restart cycles (`ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.ts:40-84`, `ui/src/state/layout.ts:311-370`, `ui/src/lib/sessionPersistence.test.ts:47-112`).
  * **Last-tab replacement guard**: Closing the final active tab in a worktree must respawn a default tab instead of collapsing the workspace layout into an empty state (`ui/src/state/workspaceStore.ts:272-286`, `ui/src/state/layout.ts:112-123`).
